<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-8990] Web console: unexpected &apos;Unsaved changes&apos; warning</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-8990</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;My steps were:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Create a new cluster configuration&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Change Client connector configuration&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Save &amp;amp; Download&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Change the cluster name&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Save &amp;amp; Download&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Go to the Monitoring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;I getting the warning about unsaved changes&lt;br/&gt;
 &lt;span class=&quot;image-wrap&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/attachment/12931269/12931269_screenshot-1.png&quot; style=&quot;border: 0px solid black&quot; /&gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The same issue if I select just Save w\o download.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
