                            <comment id="16542952" author="klaster_1" created="Fri, 13 Jul 2018 11:59:24 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;The issue was caused by improper listener lifecycle in fakeUiCanExit directive. I&apos;ve fixed it and covered with both E2E and unit tests. &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=vsisko&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;vsisko&quot;&gt;vsisko&lt;/a&gt; please test.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16549055" author="vsisko" created="Thu, 19 Jul 2018 09:34:04 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Still reproduced with &lt;b&gt;client connector configuration&lt;/b&gt; -&amp;gt; &lt;b&gt;enabled&lt;/b&gt; flag. See ignite-8990.png&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
